[Script Info]Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.709PlayResX: 1920PlayResY: 1080[V4+ Styles]Format: Name, Fontname, Fontsize, PrimaryColour, SecondaryColour, OutlineColour, BackColour, Bold, Italic, Underline, StrikeOut, ScaleX, ScaleY, Spacing, Angle, BorderStyle, Outline, Shadow, Alignment, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, EncodingStyle: Main-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Flashbacks-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Thoughts-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00525252,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,4.2,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Captions-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,56,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3,0,2,15,15,30,1Style: Title-207+,M+ ıc,95,&H00FEFEFE,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,-1,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2.5,0,2,15,15,360,1Style: Credits-207+,FOT-Greco Std DB Strp,55,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,105,105,1.5,0,1,3.7,0,7,15,15,15,1Style: Narrator-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,8,300,300,27,1Style: Secondary-207+,Impress BT Pace,82,&H00D6D6D6,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,300,300,27,1Style: Note-207+,Impress BT Pace,57,&H00FFFFFF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,&H96000000,0,-1,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.75,3.75,8,300,300,27,1Style: Warning,Impress BT Pace,90,&H00FFFFFF,&H000000FF,&H00000000,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,2,2,10,10,10,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 55,0:00:02.19,0:00:04.10,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The Great Pirate Era...Dialogue: 55,0:00:04.10,0:00:09.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,has proven to be a more tumultuous storm than the World Government expected.Dialogue: 55,0:00:10.91,0:00:18.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The figures in the eye of this relentless tempest are…Dialogue: 55,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.83,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy...Dialogue: 55,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.12,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Straw Hat Pirates!Dialogue: 55,0:00:27.50,0:00:31.38,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,To confront the furious Great Pirate Era,Dialogue: 55,0:00:31.38,0:00:35.85,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,fifty world leaders have come together for this quadrennial conference:Dialogue: 55,0:00:36.72,0:00:39.93,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,the Reverie, which will commence shortly.Dialogue: 55,0:00:44.69,0:00:48.34,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Now is a time of great change.Dialogue: 50,0:01:10.67,0:01:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:01:14.09,0:01:15.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:15.10,0:01:17.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me when I'm drinking!Dialogue: 50,0:01:17.72,0:01:18.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:01:18.89,0:01:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to!Dialogue: 50,0:01:20.18,0:01:21.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is...Dialogue: 50,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you want?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.95,0:01:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's about Straw Hat.Dialogue: 50,0:01:39.32,0:01:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's on his way to you.Dialogue: 50,0:01:42.54,0:01:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you getting at?Dialogue: 50,0:01:44.91,0:01:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, keep your hands off him!Dialogue: 50,0:01:49.38,0:01:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming to Wano to claim Straw Hat's head myself.Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of a joke?!Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entry denied!Dialogue: 50,0:01:57.34,0:02:00.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no business with you.Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.93,0:02:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I don't personally squash Straw Hat, I'll become a laughingstock.Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.39,0:02:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, he has something that I want back!Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.23,0:02:11.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care!Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.32,0:02:15.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still owe me big time, don't you?Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.90,0:02:17.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Owe you?Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.53,0:02:20.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten.Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.16,0:02:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a long time ago!Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.37,0:02:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even so, it incurred a lifetime debt.Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.00,0:02:37.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the one with the grudge against that Straw Hat brat!Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.05,0:02:39.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I'm the one who will kill him!Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.72,0:02:43.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show your face, and I'll kill you too, Linlin!Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.43,0:02:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you try.Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.22,0:02:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking your permission; this is merely a courtesy call.Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.60,0:02:54.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that? Straw Hat's head is mine!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.69,0:02:58.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's play nice... for old times' sake!Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Big Mom is on the move!Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.53,0:03:07.41,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,It seems she's contacted Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.41,0:03:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're using an unsecured channel!Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.75,0:03:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't they care if we overhear?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.92,0:03:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are they trying to provoke us?Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's play nice...Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.92,0:03:22.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What force could possibly oppose Emperors Big Mom and Kaido?Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.39,0:03:25.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The admirals? The Seven Warlords?Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.89,0:03:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Should I head out, Sakazuki?Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Borsalino.Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.48,0:03:39.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We have zero intel on Wano's military capabilities.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their samurai, you mean?Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.20,Main-207+,,0,0,5,,Seriously, Garp?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.20,0:03:51.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't Kaido and Big Mom each have a bone to pick with your grandson...Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.30,0:03:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.09,0:03:57.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a riot!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.38,0:04:02.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You realize this isn't a joke, right?Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.59,0:04:07.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'd just let two Emperors team up?Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.14,0:04:09.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not as if we can do anything right now.Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.56,0:04:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not during the Reverie anyway.Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.39,0:04:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most of our manpower has been assigned to protect royalty!Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.23,0:04:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if nothing is done...Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.19,0:04:19.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, ma'am,Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.82,0:04:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but this is Big Mom we're talkin' about.Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.07,0:04:25.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She must've known the Marines ain't gonna spare a soul,Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.41,0:04:28.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,what with the Reverie!Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.03,0:04:29.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right, but...Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did Mr. Sakazuki say?Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.54,0:04:36.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said, "Wano is a not a member country, so it's outside our jurisdiction."Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.96,0:04:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds about right!Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Best not to get involved for now!Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Garp...Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.77,0:04:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if Big Mom and Kaido are up to something again, we shouldn't take it lightly.Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.39,0:04:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all...Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.98,0:04:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they're the reason you're known as the "Hero of the Marines."Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.48,0:05:01.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rocks, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.82,0:05:06.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hina, that's a bit before your time, isn't it?Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.83,0:05:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before Roger, that era belonged to them!Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.54,0:05:15.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But that was forty years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The past is in the past.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.96,0:05:20.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though they lost their captain, their influence only grows.Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.93,0:05:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hina's worried.Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.55,0:05:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No point worrying!Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.64,0:05:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,True, they'd be a threat if they returned, but the future has a way of surprising us...Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.48,0:05:32.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are you smiling?Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hina's confused.Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.36,0:05:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You may enter, King Sterry of Goa.Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.93,0:06:06.26,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,So this is the center of the world!Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.61,0:06:23.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, swear your oath.Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.53,0:06:23.03,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.03,0:06:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C-Can I sit there?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.28,0:06:27.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't joke about such things!Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.58,0:06:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to sit upon that throne.Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.16,0:06:32.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh...?Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.75,0:06:35.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is the Empty Throne.Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.00,0:06:37.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It symbolizes equality between the nations' leaders.Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.84,0:06:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The oath affirms that no ruler will seek dominion over the rest.Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.38,0:06:44.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The 20 weapons that stand sentinel over the throneDialogue: 50,0:06:44.80,0:06:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,were placed there 800 years ago to represent the oaths of the First Twenty, the world's creators.Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.97,0:06:55.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is located at the very center of the world.Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.52,0:06:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its vacancy is evidence of peace.Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.07,0:07:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The greatest authority in the world remains with the Five Elders,Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.07,0:07:07.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the highest-ranking Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.62,0:07:12.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no one ruler of the world.Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.83,0:07:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, swear your oath, King Sterry.Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.67,0:07:25.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,If I sit there, I'll be king of the world!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.22,0:07:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Sterry?Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna sit there!Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.56,0:07:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.90,0:07:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you...?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.44,0:07:42.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please stop!Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I caught one!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.36,0:07:49.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I caught a giant mermaid!Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.16,0:07:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father...Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.62,0:08:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you expect us to overlook such disrespect, Father?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:04.05,0:08:06.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on! Calm down!Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.47,0:08:09.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please stop!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.89,0:08:12.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chain her up!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.60,0:08:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.56,0:08:18.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold it! What are you doing, Princess of Arabasta?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.77,0:08:20.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.19,0:08:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop, Rebecca!Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.48,0:08:23.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a Celestial Dragon!Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.36,0:08:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So what?! Let go of me!Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.61,0:08:27.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They lack perspective!Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.61,0:08:30.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you anger them, they'll destroy Dressrosa!Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.04,0:08:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That bastard...!Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.29,0:08:41.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Leo!Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.63,0:08:43.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi...Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.76,0:08:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, come on!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.14,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,No one interfere!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.03,0:09:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capture it, Slave #3!Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.70,0:09:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make it my pet!Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.83,0:09:20.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No standing around!Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.37,0:09:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for doing this to our boss' friend!Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.88,0:09:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.67,0:09:28.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.59,0:09:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no other way!Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you, Mermaid Princess!Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.64,0:09:34.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, Kanese soldier!Dialogue: 50,0:09:34.76,0:09:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody, stop him!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go!Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.31,0:09:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leo!Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.27,0:09:48.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you bastards?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking me.Dialogue: 50,0:09:53.70,0:09:56.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol 0...Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.95,0:09:59.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes indeedy.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.08,0:10:01.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stopping you just spared several countries.Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.33,0:10:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ruffle the feathers of Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.79,0:10:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even young'uns know that.Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.92,0:10:14.47,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol is a secret organization under the direct control of the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.47,0:10:20.93,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Aigis 0 is the top unit in the agency, boasting the most powerful agents.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.40,0:10:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sai!Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.69,0:10:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons are the gods who created this world.Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.70,0:10:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And though you are royalty, you merely rule the lower realm.Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.12,0:10:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for gods to get whatever they want.Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right, you nincompoops!Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.58,0:10:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's the logic in that?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.42,0:10:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why would a god need logic?Dialogue: 50,0:10:49.42,0:10:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lady Vivi...Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.18,0:10:56.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Otohime...Dialogue: 50,0:10:56.72,0:11:00.76,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,your dream was to live side-by-side with humansDialogue: 50,0:11:00.76,0:11:02.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,in a world of sunlight!Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.19,0:11:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Give me back Shirahoshi! She's my friend!Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Princess of Arabasta!Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.57,0:11:18.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune!Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.83,0:11:22.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget your kindness!Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.29,0:11:26.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I must let go of our dreams-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.37,0:11:27.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.59,0:11:35.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll crush them, and we'll return to our seafloor home-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.64,0:11:39.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't hit him!Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is what happens on the surface, I can never bring my people here!Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! This isn't how it is!Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.10,0:11:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune! This is not humanity!Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.11,0:11:57.20,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Otohime...!Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.99,0:12:01.87,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's face them together!Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.87,0:12:10.13,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Then maybe we can make a difference for the future of the children on this island...Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.46,0:12:13.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,even just a small one!Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.09,0:12:20.59,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we gave them our love, we can't change human nature!Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.59,0:12:23.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I have to save Shirahoshi...Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.06,0:12:24.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How dare you defy me?Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.43,0:12:27.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kill him, Cipher Pol 0!Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.77,0:12:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.31,0:12:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.81,0:12:31.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Great Knight Neptune!Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.94,0:12:32.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.73,0:12:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father, no!Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.90,0:12:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't give in to hatred!Dialogue: 50,0:12:49.16,0:12:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh...Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.54,0:12:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who hit the Celestial Dragon?!Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.67,0:13:00.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I have nothing to do with these hippos!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.14,0:13:06.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.72,0:13:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a fellow Celestial Dragon, I am ashamed!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.48,0:13:12.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please forgive us!Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.77,0:13:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is he a Celestial Dragon?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.69,0:13:18.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let go of the princess, you idiot!Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.07,0:13:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My apologies, everyone!Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.32,0:13:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This fool brought panic to a place meant for socializing!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.45,0:13:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't remember me, Neptune.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.88,0:13:38.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I am indebted to the Ryugu Kingdom and have patiently awaited this day.Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.96,0:13:41.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The day you would arrive here!Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.80,0:13:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That means... you're...Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.47,0:13:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the foolish Celestial Dragon who drifted down to the Ryugu Kingdom a decade ago.Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.06,0:13:58.94,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and save me, you imbeciles!Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.07,0:14:04.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The words of the late Queen Otohime gave me my humanity!Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.45,0:14:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would do anything to help your people!Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.83,0:14:12.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,King Neptune, it is an honor to see you again!Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.83,0:14:15.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol! Leave this place!Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.70,0:14:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What would compel you to come all this way?Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.75,0:14:54.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Reverie is at hand.Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.58,0:14:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your position normally precludes any political entanglement.Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.46,0:15:02.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We only made time because it's you.Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.17,0:15:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes... and I appreciate that.Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.51,0:15:07.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it, then.Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.26,0:15:09.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guards, would you excuse us?Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Yes, sir! – Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you about a certain pirate...Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.33,0:15:42.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The crowd's really thinned out...Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's to be expected after a mess like that.Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.13,0:15:49.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No one wants to get involved in a scandal.Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.52,0:15:55.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow!Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.93,0:15:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's that, Shirahoshi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.02,0:16:03.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bruise is completely gone!Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.32,0:16:07.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Lady Mansherry!Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.32,0:16:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful ability!Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.33,0:16:19.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think we have both the world's biggest and smallest princesses right here.Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.67,0:16:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I admit you frightened me at first.Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.79,0:16:23.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.75,0:16:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not bothered in the least, Lady Mansherry!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.34,0:16:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It seems all countries are comprised of both good and bad people.Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.47,0:16:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fishmen are no exception-jamon!Dialogue: 50,0:16:37.18,0:16:41.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I could keep my promise to Otohime.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.94,0:16:45.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to thank me, Neptune!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.28,0:16:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to return the favor for saving me ten years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.49,0:16:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the next seven days of this conference, I'll look out for Princess Shirahoshi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.58,0:16:57.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If my status can help, I'll gladly make use of it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.66,0:17:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been told that I should keep my hands off of the Celestial Dragons,Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.54,0:17:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but if you gave the order, could I kick their butts?Dialogue: 50,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes!Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.88,0:17:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's necessary to protect the princess and her companions, I'll take full responsibility!Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.76,0:17:20.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't believe an oddball like him exists.Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.40,0:17:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apologies, Your Highness.Dialogue: 50,0:17:27.03,0:17:28.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard there was trouble.Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.78,0:17:31.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should've been at your side.Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.03,0:17:32.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest easy, Pell.Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.28,0:17:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm all right.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.99,0:17:36.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how's Papa?Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.16,0:17:41.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His Majesty Cobra is talking to the one who sent that letter, Marine Admiral Fujitora.Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.42,0:17:44.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're conversing with King Riku of Dressrosa.Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.71,0:17:45.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.55,0:17:51.97,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,To get into Pangaea Castle,Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.34,0:17:56.72,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,there are three outer gates and then a main gate, all of which are guarded.Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.52,0:18:02.52,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,One of those gates is the Celestial Dragon Gate...Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.52,0:18:06.06,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,which leads to the Land of the Gods, home of the Celestial Dragons.Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.95,0:18:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Who goes there?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.12,0:18:17.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop! Who goes there?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.71,0:18:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, she's from the Kingdom of Sorbet...Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.13,0:18:26.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen Dowager Conney!Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.67,0:18:34.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of the Gods is beyond this point.Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't pass; it's dangerous to be here.Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please return to the castle.Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.01,0:18:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.52,0:18:42.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unforgivable!Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that Mjosgard!Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.10,0:18:46.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Charlos! Please be calm!Dialogue: 50,0:18:46.86,0:18:48.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll aggravate your wounds!Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.82,0:18:52.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can't get away with this!Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.69,0:18:54.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open the gate!Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.78,0:18:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.11,0:18:57.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Charlos is injured!Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He requires urgent care!Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right away!Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.17,0:19:16.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! He requires medical assistance!Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.93,0:19:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Charlos!Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.73,0:19:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard what happened.Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.35,0:19:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was on my way to pick you up!Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.11,0:19:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saint Rosward!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.86,0:19:34.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Daddy dearest!Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.03,0:19:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you!Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dearest sonny boy!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.08,0:19:50.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did the queen dowager go?Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn that Mjosgard!Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.51,0:19:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pay for this!Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's always been a strange man...Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.01,0:20:01.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Celestial Dragon who doesn't own a single slave!Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.18,0:20:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like Homing who descended to the lower realm thirty years ago!Dialogue: 50,0:20:05.48,0:20:10.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Donquixote family is full of lunatics!Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.48,0:20:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy dearest, that's...Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.24,0:20:20.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the invincible slave, Kuma!Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.53,0:20:22.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right!Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.24,0:20:26.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My turn to rent him finally came!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is so exciting!Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.17,0:20:34.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy dearest finally got to rent the invincible slave Kuma!Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.59,0:20:38.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's convenient to have a Warlord as a slave!Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.05,0:20:40.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can hit him!Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.43,0:20:42.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could even stab him!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.81,0:20:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet he doesn't ever scream.Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.23,0:20:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a top-class slave!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.19,0:20:53.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice, Daddy Dearest!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.40,0:20:55.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want one too!Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.40,0:20:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.99,0:20:59.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna die!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please remain calm, Saint Charlos!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did a number on me!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.50,0:21:10.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, poor Charlos!Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.00,0:21:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get the world's greatest doctor to look at you!Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.09,0:21:21.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect I'd see him so soon!Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.02,0:21:32.06,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,My infiltration was a success.Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.53,0:21:39.86,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive them!Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.20,0:21:44.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Not ever!Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.45,0:21:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.84,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,Don't get in a tizzy, Sabo!Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.84,0:21:58.30,Main-207+,,0,0,15,,You boys can all be so scary!Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.30,0:22:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't help but get mad!Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.17,0:22:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our comrade is going through hell!Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our gentle Kuma!Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.68,0:22:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's unthinkable...Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.35,0:22:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down.Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.98,0:22:16.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We get it.Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.52,0:22:18.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We all feel the same way.Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.61,0:22:21.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We won't leave Kuma to this fate!Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.19,0:22:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, he's one of the reasons we came here.Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.58,0:22:32.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having said that, even if we set him free, he'll never return to his old self.Dialogue: 50,0:22:33.87,0:22:39.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still, let's not forget that our Kuma is a prime example of the World Government's oppression!Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.55,0:22:43.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since Kuma is the former king of a member nation,Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.22,0:22:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,they wanted to make an example out of him as a warning.Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.26,0:22:52.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To show that no matter how tough you are, this is how you end up if you disobey the gods!Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.43,0:22:56.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Dragons have CP0 and Marine Headquarters in their corner.Dialogue: 50,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we fail and get caught...Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.57,0:23:02.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No. Failure is not an option.Dialogue: 50,0:23:02.94,0:23:04.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We either succeed...Dialogue: 50,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or we die!Dialogue: 50,0:23:13.71,0:23:17.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,At long last, the Reverie is here!Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.84,0:23:20.71,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The four oceans of the world...Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.34,0:23:25.05,Narrator-207+,,0,0,2,,are separated by a continental wall—the Red Line—Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.05,0:23:29.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,2,,and the deadly seas of the Grand Line and the New World,Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.68,0:23:33.68,Narrator-207+,,0,0,2,,which is where Luffy and his crew are adventuring.Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.52,0:23:38.15,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Government is a truly massive organization.Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.15,0:23:42.07,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Most countries in the world are members: 170 nations total!Dialogue: 50,0:23:42.90,0:23:50.24,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Of those, fifty monarchs are chosen as representatives to assemble in the Holy Land every four years.Dialogue: 50,0:23:57.67,0:23:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh-Where's my seat?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.47,0:24:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally.Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.84,0:24:10.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How's your country been?Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.35,0:24:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You said it was ravaged by pirates four years ago?Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.56,0:24:20.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Fleet Admiral Sakazuki, they were sent to Impel Down.Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.02,0:24:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speaking of pirates, lately there's been one name on everyone's lips.Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.86,0:24:25.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think it was...Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.32,0:24:27.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy, right?Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.61,0:24:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He attempted to assassinate Big Mom, and rumor has it that he's going after Kaido next.Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.25,0:24:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.79,0:24:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean Wano is next in line for disaster?Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.04,0:24:45.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano is not affiliated with the World Government, which effectively makes it a lawless land.Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.63,0:24:50.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't even know if it operates as a country.Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.64,0:24:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing we can do?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.06,0:24:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sending the Marines would cost money.Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.52,0:25:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trouble seems to follow this Straw Hat Luffy wherever he goes.Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.49,0:25:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got that right!Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.41,0:25:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, Prodence?Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.20,0:25:16.24,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.91,0:25:19.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The position of chairman always rotates.Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.29,0:25:21.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is it this time?Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.92,0:25:23.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would be me!Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.42,0:25:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everyone, it will be my honor.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.67,0:25:27.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ballywood, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:25:27.38,0:25:29.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.Dialogue: 50,0:25:29.09,0:25:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This should run smoothly, then.Dialogue: 50,0:25:32.47,0:25:36.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we have a full seven days, we have so much to address.Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.81,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the great conference that determines the order of the world.Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.48,0:25:43.90,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It is known as...Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.69,0:25:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well then, my fellow monarchs...Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.28,0:25:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,let us carefully discuss the future of this beautiful world!Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.08,0:26:02.50,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,...the Reverie!Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.79,0:26:06.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so the conference begins...Dialogue: 50,0:26:06.88,0:26:13.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, King Cobra of Arabasta is requesting an audience with us.Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.76,0:26:19.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Nefertari family was the only member of the First TwentyDialogue: 50,0:26:19.72,0:26:22.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that stayed in the lower realm 800 years ago.Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.69,0:26:25.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In a sense, they're traitors.Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.19,0:26:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Has he noticed something?Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.52,0:26:30.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hope he doesn't complicate matters.Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.57,0:26:34.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You could say the same about the situation with Big Mom and Kaido.Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.70,0:26:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since the Summit War.Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.03,0:26:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet this maelstrom will not cease.Dialogue: 50,0:26:40.58,0:26:45.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This world's equilibrium cannot be maintained indefinitely.Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.92,0:26:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The time has come for a great cleansing.Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.69,0:27:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lord Imu.Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.19,0:27:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Five Elders have arrived.Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.00,0:28:14.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you discovered another light to be erased from history?Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.63,0:28:17.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it decided, then?Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.05,0:28:24.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If so, you need only give us the name!Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:01:00.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Empty ThroneDialogue: 1,0:00:55.24,0:01:00.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,The Empty ThroneDialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 1,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:07.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,New MarinefordDialogue: 1,0:03:02.58,0:03:07.42,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,New MarinefordDialogue: 0,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,The Red PortDialogue: 1,0:03:44.58,0:03:47.21,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,The Red PortDialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Gion (Momousagi) Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 1,0:04:03.26,0:04:07.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Gion (Momousagi) Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:28.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Tokikake (Chaton) Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 1,0:04:22.53,0:04:28.04,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Tokikake (Chaton) Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral Hina Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 1,0:04:49.27,0:04:53.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Rear Admiral Hina Marine HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:05:33.81,0:05:33.86,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Pangaea CastleDialogue: 1,0:05:33.81,0:05:33.86,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Pangaea CastleDialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:33.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Pangaea CastleDialogue: 1,0:05:33.86,0:05:33.90,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,Pangaea CastleDialogue: 